  "wikitext": "Builds, also called production lines, are sets of building which produce a particular asset(s).\n\n== Drug build ==\n\n\n==== Full Production Set ==== \n 144x [[Prescription drug factory|Drug factories]]\n  15x [[Research chemical factory|Chem factories]]\n   2x [[Oil well]]s\n Profit (raw): $10,368,000/h\n\nCan be perfectly duplicated.\n\n==== 111 Land set ====\n 96x Drug factories\n 10x Chem factories\n  2x Oil well\n  1x [[HQ]]\n  1x [[Retail store|Retail]]\n  1x [[Logistics center]]\n Profit: approx. $8,500,000/h",
