  "html": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p>Builds, also called production lines, are sets of building which produce a particular asset(s).\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Drug_build\">Drug build</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Builds&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Drug build\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Full_Production_Set\">Full Production Set</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Builds&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Full Production Set\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h4>\n<pre>144x <a href=\"/index.php/Prescription_drug_factory\" title=\"Prescription drug factory\">Drug factories</a>\n 15x <a href=\"/index.php/Research_chemical_factory\" title=\"Research chemical factory\">Chem factories</a>\n  2x <a href=\"/index.php/Oil_well\" title=\"Oil well\">Oil wells</a>\nProfit (raw): $10,368,000/h\n</pre>\n<p>Can be perfectly duplicated.\n</p>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"111_Land_set\">111 Land set</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Builds&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: 111 Land set\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h4>\n<pre>96x Drug factories\n10x Chem factories\n 2x Oil well\n 1x <a href=\"/index.php/HQ\" title=\"HQ\">HQ</a>\n 1x <a href=\"/index.php/Retail_store\" title=\"Retail store\">Retail</a>\n 1x <a href=\"/index.php/Logistics_center\" title=\"Logistics center\">Logistics center</a>\nProfit: approx. $8,500,000/h\n</pre>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261008232943\nCache expiry: 86400\nDynamic content: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.004 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.005 seconds\nPr